       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SAMMENLIGNLANDKODE.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 IX               PIC 9.
       01 MATCH-COUNT      PIC 99.
       01 KODE-LENGTH      PIC 99  VALUE 2.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 KUNDE-LAND       PIC XX.
       01 SANKTIONS-LAND   PIC XX.
       01 MATCH-PROCENT    PIC 999.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING KUNDE-LAND SANKTIONS-LAND MATCH-PROCENT.
       MOVE 0 TO MATCH-COUNT
       PERFORM VARYING IX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IX > KODE-LENGTH
           IF KUNDE-LAND(IX:1) = SANKTIONS-LAND(IX:1)
               ADD 1 TO MATCH-COUNT
           END-IF
       END-PERFORM

       CALL 'OMREGNTILPROCENT' USING CONTENT MATCH-COUNT KODE-LENGTH
           REFERENCE MATCH-PROCENT

       EXIT PROGRAM.
